course: dictionary
lesson: 7529
title: Pranks: fun or hurtful?
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A prank is a trick played on someone to make people laugh. To prank someone means to play such a trick on them. Pranks can be harmless fun, but they can also hurt people, so think before you play one.
explain: A good prank is one that everyone can laugh at, including the person tricked. «A prank can be fun if everyone laughs together, including the person tricked.» Ask yourself: will this make someone scared, embarrassed or hurt?
explain: Some pranks are cruel. «Pulling chairs, tripping and pushing people into water are "pranks" that cause broken bones and head injuries.» Calling something "just a joke" does not stop it from hurting someone, so the word prank does not make an action okay.
fact: A prank is a trick played on someone to make people laugh.
fact: To prank someone means to play a trick on them. Prank can be a noun or an informal verb.
fact: «April Fools' Day» is a day when people play tricks; in the UK and Ireland, tradition says the tricks should be done before midday.
fact: A prank is harmless when the person tricked can laugh too.
fact: A prank becomes unkind when it hurts, scares, embarrasses or bullies someone.
exercise: «A prank can be fun if everyone laughs together.» What is a prank? | A long walk in the rain | *A trick played on someone to make people laugh | A school test
exercise: «Aroha forgave a friend for a cruel prank.» What does cruel mean here? | Very quiet | Funny and kind | *Unkind and hurtful | Lucky
exercise: Which prank is most likely to be harmless? | *A rubber spider on a desk, and everyone laughs, including the person tricked | Tripping someone on the stairs | Pulling a chair away so someone falls | Pushing someone into water
test: Does a prank that upsets people become okay if you say it was just a joke? | Only on April Fools' Day | *No, a trick that upsets people is not just a joke | Yes, always
test: When is a prank harmless? | *When the person tricked can laugh too | When it hurts someone | When it scares someone badly | When it breaks something
exam: Which of these is an unkind prank? | An April Fools' trick that everyone laughs at | A joke about a funny hat that makes the whole class giggle | A prank call that makes your friends laugh together | *Pulling a chair away so that someone falls and gets hurt
